build: 2026-06-23 v10.54.0 (DMMW Arrangement — visual timeline canvas with live playhead)
branch: claude/piano-roll-clip-view-wozlie
notes: Continues professionally building out the Arrangement DMMW pillar. Adds a horizontal timeline overview above the section list: each section is a coloured bar whose WIDTH is proportional to its length, laid out left→right in play order, the currently-playing section highlighted, and a live bio-green playhead (riding the authoritative Transport) sweeping across while the song plays — an at-a-glance map of the whole song. Wraps within the song so a looping arrangement keeps the playhead on-screen. Pure SwiftUI over the existing ArrangementStore/Transport; the vertical list stays the editor. Builds directly on v10.53.0's Transport unification. iOS compile gate validates the view.
